        "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
        "Label": "IMPLICATIONS",
        "content": "We examined the effects of preoperative epidural morphine associated with general anesthesia on postoperative morphine requirements. Twenty-one children older than 6 yr scheduled for major surgery were randomly assigned to two groups, a control group and an epidural group that received a single epidural morphine injection."
